      "facts": [
        "Templates we host a live copy of, by template id: what a gallery's Preview opens before someone starts from the template. A template missing here has no Preview.",
        "Kept beside the published catalogue rather than in it: the catalogue schema is strict, so a new field there would make installed clients reject every template. `scripts/templates/deploy-previews.ts` rewrites the JSON."
