        "calls": 1,
        "title": "Add template live preview support",
        "summary": "A new live preview mechanism for starter templates is introduced in the `common` package, where a template's preview URL is kept in a separate JSON file rather than the strict catalogue schema to prevent installed clients from rejecting new fields. The `TemplateTracker` type in `analytics.ts` is extended with a `clicked` state to distinguish when a user opens a live copy from when they select the template itself. The JSON file currently maps `bedwars` and `chess` template IDs to specific `freebuff.page` or `buffcraft.freebuff.app` domains.",
        "significance": "notable",
        "audience": "end-users",
        "evidence": "The diff adds `common/src/templates/live-previews.ts` and `live-previews.json`, and modifies `common/src/templates/analytics.ts` to include a `'clicked'` state in the `TemplateTracker` type.",
